        "description": "Creates and submits, then returns the ZATCA Phase 1 QR as a base64 PNG.\n\nExpect `grand_total: 575`, `zatca.available: true`, `phase: Phase 1`, and a QR of roughly 1100-1600 bytes. Warnings about the buyer address are expected here \u2014 this is a B2C (simplified) invoice, which needs none.\n\nThe QR is stored in `{{last_qr_png}}`. To view it, paste `data:image/png;base64,<value>` into a browser address bar.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"external_id\": \"{{external_id}}\",\n  \"customer\": \"{{customer_b2c}}\",\n  \"company\": \"{{company}}\",\n  \"posting_date\": \"{{posting_date}}\",\n  \"posting_time\": \"11:30:00\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"item_code\": \"{{item_code}}\",\n      \"qty\": 2,\n      \"rate\": 250\n    }\n  ]\n}",
          "options": {
