        "description": "All three VAT categories on one invoice: standard, zero-rated and exempt.\n\nVerified against ZATCA's Phase 2 sandbox \u2014 this exact shape cleared, and the UBL it produced\ncarried three VAT subtotals:\n\n| Category | Taxable | Tax | Rate | Exemption reason |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `S` standard | 1000 | 150 | 15% | \u2014 |\n| `Z` zero-rated | 1000 | 0 | 0% | `VATEX-SA-32` |\n| `E` exempt | 1000 | 0 | 0% | `VATEX-SA-29` |\n\nHeader totals: 3000 excluding VAT, 3150 including. The exemption reason codes come from the\ntemplate's own ZATCA category \u2014 you send the template name, we hold the mapping.\n\nThree distinct `item_code` values, one per category. That is mandatory, not stylistic.",
        "body": {
          "raw": "{\n  \"external_id\": \"{{external_id}}\",\n  \"customer\": \"{{customer_b2b}}\",\n  \"company\": \"{{company}}\",\n  \"tax_id\": \"{{buyer_vat}}\",\n  \"address_title\": \"{{customer_b2b}} Billing\",\n  \"address_parts\": {\n    \"street\": \"Olaya Street\",\n    \"building_number\": \"4521\",\n    \"district\": \"Al Murabba\",\n    \"city\": \"Riyadh\",\n    \"postal_code\": \"12613\",\n    \"country\": \"Saudi Arabia\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"item_code\": \"{{item_code}}\",\n      \"qty\": 1,\n      \"rate\": 1000,\n      \"uom\": \"Nos\",\n      \"item_tax_template\": \"{{item_tax_standard}}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"item_code\": \"{{item_code_zero}}\",\n      \"qty\": 1,\n      \"rate\": 1000,\n      \"uom\": \"Nos\",\n      \"item_tax_template\": \"{{item_tax_zero}}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"item_code\": \"{{item_code_exempt}}\",\n      \"qty\": 1,\n      \"rate\": 1000,\n      \"uom\": \"Nos\",\n      \"item_tax_template\": \"{{item_tax_exempt}}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"submit\": true\n}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// A fresh external_id every run, so this creates rather than dedupes.",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"external_id\", \"PM-\" + Date.now());",
              ""
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const env = body.message;",
              "pm.test(\"success = true\", () => pm.expect(env.success, JSON.stringify(env.errors)).to.be.true);",
              "pm.test(\"no errors\", () => pm.expect(env.errors).to.be.an(\"array\").that.is.empty);",
              "const data = env.data;",
              "pm.test(\"net 3000\", () => pm.expect(data.invoice.net_total).to.eql(3000));",
              "pm.test(\"VAT 150\", () => pm.expect(data.invoice.total_taxes_and_charges).to.eql(150));",
              "pm.test(\"grand 3150\", () => pm.expect(data.invoice.grand_total).to.eql(3150));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"last_b2b_invoice\", data.invoice.invoice);",
              ""
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
